  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よろしくお願いします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We look forward to your support!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "不要",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いざステージに立つと緊張してきちゃった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now that I'm actually on stage, I'm getting nervous!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頑張れ、イザナちゃん！\n応援してるよー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You can do it, Izana! I'm cheering for you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……どうだ？\u3000久しぶりの街は。\nずっと入院してたんだ。疲れたらすぐに言うんだぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...How is it? It's been a while since you've been in town. You were hospitalized for so long. Tell me right away if you get tired."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "心配性の兄",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Worried Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "心配しすぎだよ兄さん。もう病気は治ったんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You worry too much. I'm all better now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "天真爛漫な弟",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cheerful Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ！\u3000あそこ、何かやってるみたいだよ！\n見に行こうよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! Something's going on over there! Let's go check it out!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "天真爛漫な弟",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cheerful Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こら、急に走るな……ん、あれは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, don't run off so suddenly... Hm, that's..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "心配性の兄",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Worried Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わあ、兄さん、あれってアイドル！？\n入院してた時に動画で見せてくれたのと同じ人？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow, are those idols?! Are they the same ones you showed me videos of when I was in the hospital?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "天真爛漫な弟",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cheerful Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや、違うみたいだが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, they seem to be different..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "心配性の兄",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Worried Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "天真爛漫な弟",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cheerful Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それではアタシたちの曲、聞いてください！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now please enjoy our song!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとうございました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you so much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "三人",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Group"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
