  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとうございました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you so much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "不要",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナちゃん、みんな！\u3000とっても良かったよ！\n私もすっごく楽しかった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana, everyone! That was wonderful! I had such a great time!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほんと！？\u3000やったー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really?! Yes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "客はほとんどいなかったっていうのに、\nあんたは楽しそうね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There was hardly anyone in the audience, yet you seem so happy..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000だって、とっても楽しいから！\nレスナちゃんも楽しそうだし！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! Because it was so much fun! And you looked like you were having fun too, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
