        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今日は、拙者たちの初ライブを見てくださって\nありがとうございました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you so much for coming to see our first live performance today!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これからどんどん頑張ってまいります。",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're going to keep working hard from here on out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうぞ『Ｃｕｔｉｅ☆ＡｎｉｍａＬ』を\nよろしくお願いしまする！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please continue to support Cutie☆AnimaL!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ……あのっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "U-um...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "天真爛漫な弟",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cheerful Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ライブ、とっても楽しかったです！\n活動頑張ってください！\u3000応援してます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your performance was really fun! Good luck with your activities! We'll be cheering for you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "天真爛漫な弟",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Cheerful Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "弟と共に、これからの活動を楽しみにしている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My brother and I are both looking forward to your future activities."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "心配性の兄",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Worried Brother"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "～～っ！\u3000ありがとうございまする！\nぜひ、またライブに来てくだされ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you so much! Please come see us perform again!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
